{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>SnapTrail 是一款旅遊日記 App，讓用家把旅途中的地點、心情、開支與相片整理成清晰的數碼記錄，適合旅遊愛好者、內容創作者與喜歡書寫生活日誌的人士。程式原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-95.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>記錄旅途點滴與開支</h2>\n<p>SnapTrail 以簡潔介面把旅途細節集中一處，可為每段回憶記錄地點、心情、開支與相片，並整理成編排整齊的旅遊相簿。用家能按時間順序保存故事，日後隨時翻看每次出走。程式亦提供分享選項，可將日誌設為私人、只限指定追蹤者觀看或全面公開，方便親友與同好緊貼行程。無論熱愛環遊世界、喜歡公路旅行，還是習慣書寫數碼旅遊日記，都能藉此建立專屬記錄。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-331-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-332-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-333-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-334-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-335-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-336-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：SnapTrail: Capture Moments</li><li>應用類別：Travel</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/snaptrail-capture-moments/id6670402606?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T18:00:30.246706+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":341,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T17:46:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T12:58:35.776267+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T17:58:23.954143+00:00","content_hash":"8875e5ecf8822a0ed01e69ba7472b642f919caa583d2a816c988f2293bafe53f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}